WEBVTT

00:18:26.052 --> 00:18:30.039
and the same as our basis for trust in anything,

00:18:30.039 --> 00:18:32.317
namely, experience.

00:18:32.317 --> 00:18:34.161
But it shouldn't be blind trust

00:18:34.161 --> 00:18:36.921
any more than we would have blind trust in anything.

00:18:36.921 --> 00:18:39.762
Our trust in science, like science itself,

00:18:39.762 --> 00:18:41.675
should be based on evidence,

00:18:41.675 --> 00:18:43.177
and that means that scientists

00:18:43.177 --> 00:18:45.225
have to become better communicators.

00:18:45.225 --> 00:18:48.112
They have to explain to us not just what they know

00:18:48.112 --> 00:18:49.840
but how they know it,

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:53.730
and it means that we have
to become better listeners.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.149
Thank you very much.

00:18:55.149 --> 00:18:57.452
(Applause)